## Summary by CodeRabbit

* **Bug Fixes**
  * Clearing response headers without specifying names now removes all headers reliably, including multiple cookie headers. Specifying a header name continues to remove only that header, leaving other response headers unchanged. This makes header-clearing behavior more consistent across responses and preserves unrelated headers when clearing a specific one.

